---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Brazilian Wax Albuquerque — ABQWax.ing"
  description="Brazilian wax Albuquerque: hard wax technique, what to expect, how to prepare, and aftercare. Plus the domain built to own the query — ABQWax.ing, offered at $250,000."
  canonical="/brazilian-wax-albuquerque/"
  keywords="Brazilian wax Albuquerque, Brazilian wax near me, Albuquerque Brazilian wax, hard wax Brazilian Albuquerque, ABQWax.ing"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Brazilian Wax Albuquerque', path: '/brazilian-wax-albuquerque/' },
  ]}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="border-b border-ink-100 bg-ink-950">
      <div class="container-narrow py-16 sm:py-24">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-400">Albuquerque · Brazilian Wax · Guide</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
          Brazilian wax in Albuquerque, from prep to aftercare
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-100/85 sm:text-lg">
          The Brazilian wax is the most searched single service in the category. Here is how it works, what to expect, and the domain that already answers the query.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-800 sm:text-base">
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Why hard wax leads Brazilian work</h2>
          <p>
            A Brazilian wax removes hair from the front, back, and in between, leaving the area smooth. For this delicate
            service, <strong class="text-ink-950">hard wax</strong> is the standard: it shrinks around the hair, gripping the
            strand rather than the skin, which reduces pain and irritation compared to strip wax.
          </p>
          <p>
            In Albuquerque, the term <strong class="text-ink-950">Brazilian wax Albuquerque</strong> is a high-intent query.
            A domain that carries the city and the service — <strong class="text-ink-950">ABQWax.ing</strong> — reads as the
            exact search, so a studio holding it starts one step ahead of every competitor bidding on the same phrase.
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950">What to expect and how to prepare</h2>
          <p>
            Let hair grow to about a quarter inch before the appointment. Exfoliate gently a day or two ahead, and avoid
            caffeine on the day if you are sensitive. The treatment itself typically takes fifteen to thirty minutes, and a
            skilled technician moves in small sections to keep the process efficient.
          </p>
          <p>
            Aftercare is simple: loose clothing, no hot tubs or intense workouts for twenty-four hours, and gentle exfoliation
            after a couple of days to prevent ingrowns. See the
            <a href="/hard-wax-albuquerque/" class="font-medium text-gold-500 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">hard wax guide</a>
            for why technique matters here.
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="rounded-3xl border border-ink-100 bg-ink-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The domain</p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950">ABQWax.ing</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-700">City, category, and the service verb in one hostname. Built to own Brazilian wax Albuquerque search.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-gold-500">$250,000</p>
          <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-primary mt-4">Request terms</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-padding bg-ink-50">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">Brazilian wax questions, answered</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">How long does a Brazilian last?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Three to four weeks. With a consistent schedule, regrowth softens and sessions get faster.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Does it hurt?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">There is brief discomfort, but hard wax is far gentler than strip wax for sensitive areas, and it lessens with each visit.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">How long should hair be?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">About a quarter inch, or two to three weeks of growth, so the wax can grip cleanly.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">What should I avoid after?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Skip hot tubs, tight clothing, and heavy exercise for 24 hours, and exfoliate after a couple of days.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
